        ":question/problem": "![](images/5b/5bf9b4c229fee9eb1b15fecd46e0026a63882140ff0da85a868dcc2121eccfc2.png)\n\nIn the diagram, $L$ lies on the segment $XW$. The given vectors are $\\overrightarrow{XO}=c$ and $\\overrightarrow{OW}=d$. The lengths satisfy $XL:LW=4:5$.\n\nExpress $\\overrightarrow{LO}$ in terms of $c$ and $d$. Fill in both coefficients, including their signs.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{LO}=$ {{field-1}} $c+$ {{field-2}} $d$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "First express both endpoint vectors in the directions away from $O$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{OX}=-c\\qquad \\overrightarrow{OW}=d .\n$$\n\nTrace the path from $X$ through $O$ to $W$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{XW}=\\overrightarrow{XO}+\\overrightarrow{OW}=c+d.\n$$\n\nThe ratio $XL:LW=4:5$ gives $9$ parts in the whole segment. Thus\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{XL}=\\frac{4}{9}\\overrightarrow{XW}=\\frac{4}{9}(c+d).\n$$\n\nAdd along the path $O\\to X\\to L$ and collect coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overrightarrow{OL}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XL}\\\\&=-c+\\frac{4}{9}(c+d)\\\\&=-\\frac{5}{9}c+\\frac{4}{9}d.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe requested vector has the reverse direction, so negate both coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{LO}=-\\overrightarrow{OL}=\\frac{5}{9}c-\\frac{4}{9}d.\n$$",
